{"text": "In the attic, Narek found an old radio. It was dusty and quiet. 'It was my father's,' said Grandpa. 'It doesn't work any more.' Narek had an idea. He and Grandpa cleaned the radio and opened it carefully. Grandpa changed a small broken part. Then Narek turned the button. Suddenly, music filled the room! Grandpa closed his eyes and listened. 'This song is from my childhood,' he said softly.", "words": [[0.18, 0.28], [0.32, 0.4], [0.48, 0.84], [1.26, 1.6], [1.7, 1.98], [2.02, 2.1], [2.16, 2.32], [2.38, 2.74], [3.84, 3.92], [3.98, 4.12], [4.22, 4.64], [4.74, 4.88], [4.94, 5.4], [5.52, 6.48], [6.52, 6.64], [6.68, 6.84], [6.9, 7.52], [7.76, 7.92], [7.96, 8.36], [8.56, 9.56], [9.62, 9.96], [10.02, 10.32], [10.4, 10.56], [10.64, 11.88], [12.68, 13.12], [13.2, 13.34], [13.4, 13.48], [13.62, 13.96], [14.98, 15.04], [15.2, 15.32], [15.36, 15.74], [15.92, 16.26], [16.28, 16.34], [16.4, 16.74], [17.12, 17.24], [17.3, 17.62], [17.66, 17.74], [17.8, 18.28], [19.26, 19.66], [19.84, 20.32], [20.36, 20.39], [20.48, 20.86], [20.96, 21.32], [21.38, 21.72], [22.74, 23.0], [23.12, 23.5], [23.64, 23.94], [23.96, 24.02], [24.06, 24.38], [25.44, 25.88], [26.22, 26.74], [26.88, 27.24], [27.28, 27.38], [27.44, 27.74], [28.74, 29.1], [29.28, 29.64], [29.68, 29.8], [29.9, 30.22], [30.28, 30.38], [30.44, 30.92], [31.02, 32.02], [32.14, 32.4], [32.46, 32.54], [32.58, 32.74], [32.8, 32.94], [33.02, 33.86], [34.0, 34.06], [34.16, 34.36], [34.44, 35.021]], "tag": "chatterbox:sonia", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc2", "clamped": 1}